# Force LF in the repository for everything text.
#
# The workflow YAML and Python run on Linux runners. A Windows clone that
# committed CRLF would produce a diff touching every line of every file, and
# CRLF in .github/workflows/*.yml can break Actions parsing outright.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
